Article 804. Safety consultation of flight crew when operating more than one type or variant of aircraft
When changing the aircraft type or variant during a flight sequence, the flight crew's safety consultation must include:
1. Typical contents of normal and specific emergency procedures according to aircraft type;
2. Safety and emergency equipment applicable to the actual aircraft will be operated for the next flight immediately afterward.
Chapter II
