7. Hành khách mang theo động vật.</p>","translations":{"en":"Article 820. Direct access to emergency exit doors

Article 820. Direct access to emergency exit doors
The following groups of passengers are not allowed to sit or be instructed to sit in seats with direct access to emergency exits:
1. Passengers with physical or mental disabilities such that they have difficulty moving quickly when required.
2. The passenger has such a severe visual or hearing impairment that he cannot easily accept written or verbal instructions.
3. Passengers due to age or poor health condition have difficulty moving quickly.
4. Passengers are so obese that they have difficulty moving quickly or approaching or passing through the adjacent emergency exit door.
5. Children, including children accompanied or unaccompanied by an adult, and infants.
6. Deported people, passengers not allowed to enter the country or people being escorted.
7. Passengers carrying animals."},"translatedText":"Article 820. Direct access to emergency exit doors

