Article 870. Contents of aircraft type change training for flight attendants
The aircraft type conversion training program includes the following content:
1. Description of the aircraft, configuration, and systems on the aircraft.
2. Location and use of safety and emergency equipment on aircraft related to the duties of flight attendants.
3. Means of emergency escape.
4. Location and operation of aircraft doors and emergency exits in normal and emergency modes.
5. Complete practice for the contents specified in Clauses 2, 3 and 4 of this Article.
6. Check capacity as prescribed in this Part."},"translatedText":"Article 870. Contents of aircraft type change training for flight attendants

