Article 893. Initial training program for flight instructors
1. Aircraft operators ensure flight instructors complete the initial training program specified in the training program before performing their duties.
2. The initial training program for flight instructors includes the following contents:
No
Body of knowledge and skills
Detailed content
1
Theoretical training
Theoretical training has a minimum duration of 08 hours, including flight operations documentation system, safety and quality documentation system, and standard operating procedures; policies, procedures, standards and training methods
2
Practical training
For flight instructors on aircraft: conduct training under supervision in 02 training lessons on aircraft or on simulated flight training equipment.
For flight instructors on simulators: conduct training under supervision in 02 training exercises on simulators."},"translatedText":"Article 893. Initial training program for flight instructors

