Article 894. Periodic training program for flight instructors
1. Aircraft operators ensure flight instructors complete a periodic training program for flight instructors with a duration of at least 04 hours within a 24-month period specified in the training program.
2. The periodic training program for flight instructors includes the following contents:
No
Review and update categories
Detailed content
1
Update regulations and documentation system
Update changes in the system of legal documents related to aircraft pilots and standard operating procedures of aircraft operators; Update information from the safety management system and report incidents and actual safety events.
2
Standardize assessment skills
Practice cross-assessment to ensure consistency among flight instructors in the same flight team on assessment methods, assessment standards and how to record training results.
3
Review pedagogical skills
Learn from practical difficulties in teaching; Review training skills and handling methods for students who do not meet the requirements."},"translatedText":"Article 894. Periodic training program for flight instructors

