Managing pressure in aircraft operations; fatigue management; situational awareness, information gathering and processing; manage and use helicopter automation systems; problem solving and decision making; Manage flight crew resources in a helicopter operating environment, including offshore operations or helicopter medical emergency operations where applicable.
08 o'clock
Aviation security for main pilot
Responsibilities of the main pilot according to Vietnamese law on aviation security; handle illegal interference and disruptive behavior; Identify and handle suspicious items on aircraft.
