Article 919. Responsibilities of flight crew members
1. Flight crew must comply with flight time limits, duty time and rest time requirements applicable to their operations;
2. In case of performing duties for more than one aircraft operator, the flight crew maintains personal records related to flight time, duty time and rest time according to current regulations and provides each aircraft operator with necessary data to arrange flight schedules in accordance with current requirements;
3. The flight crew takes full advantage of the rest opportunities and facilities provided, and plans and uses rest time appropriately."},"translatedText":"Article 919. Responsibilities of flight crew members

