Article 925. Flight time and duty time
1. Total maximum duty time of flight crew members is specified as follows:
a) 60 hours of duty in 07 consecutive days;
b) 110 hours of duty in 14 consecutive days;
c) 190 hours of duty in 28 consecutive days and evenly distributed throughout that period.
2. The maximum total flight time of a flight crew member is specified as follows:
a) 100 flight hours in 28 consecutive days;
b) 1000 flight hours in 12 consecutive months.
3. Post-flight duties are counted as duty time."},"translatedText":"Article 925. Flight time and duty time

