2. For reserve duties outside the airport:
a) The maximum total time to perform reserve duty is 16 hours;
b) Aircraft operators must have a process to ensure that the total time for reserve duty and FDP is a maximum of 18 hours;
c) 25% of the time spent performing reserve duties other than reserve duties at the airport is counted as duty time;
d) After performing reserve duty, the aircraft operator must arrange rest time for flight crew members according to regulations;
d) The reserve duty is considered to end when the flight crew member is present to receive the duty at the designated location;
e) In case the reserve duty ends within the first 06 hours, the maximum FDP is calculated from the time of showing up for duty;
g) In case the reserve duty ends beyond the first 06 hours, the maximum FDP must be shortened by a Time equal to the Time in excess of 06 hours;
h) In case the FDP is extended due to in-flight rest or intermittent duty, the 06-hour period in points e and g of this Clause is increased to 08 hours;
i) In case the start time of reserve duty is between 23:00 and 07:00, the time between 23:00 and 07:00 is not counted to reduce FDP according to the provisions of Points e, g and h of this Clause until the flight crew member is contacted by the aircraft operator;
k) The aircraft operator must determine the appropriate time between the time of the call requesting to be present to receive duty and the time to be present to receive duty to ensure that flight crew members move from their resting place to the location where they are required to be present to receive duty within the appropriate time."},"930":{"id":"930","code":"Điều 930","title":"Điều 930. Nhiệm vụ dự phòng","chapter":"Chương II - QUẢN LÝ MỆT MỎI TRONG VẬN TẢI HÀNG KHÔNG THƯƠNG MẠI BẰNG MÁY BAY - KHAI THÁC THƯỜNG LỆ, VÀ KHAI THÁC KHÔNG THƯỜNG LỆ BẰNG MÁY BAY CÓ CẤU HÌNH TRÊN 19 GHẾ KHÁCH","partTitle":"Phần XV - QUẢN LÝ MỆT MỎI CỦA NGƯỜI KHAI THÁC CÓ GIẤY CHỨNG NHẬN NGƯỜI KHAI THÁC TÀU BAY","partId":"main_part_15","plainText":"Điều 930. Nhiệm vụ dự phòng
