Article 946. Rest period
1. For interrupted flight schedules:
a) In case the flight schedule of a flight crew member at the main base changes from a late-finishing duty or night duty to an early-starting duty, the rest time between the two FDPs must include 01 night at the local or a maximum of 11 hours of second duty time and the rest time after the second duty time must include 01 night at the locality.
