2. Khi xây dựng các quy trình tránh chướng ngại vật trong giai đoạn cất cánh, hạ cánh và bay lại, người khai thác tàu bay phải tính đến dữ liệu chướng ngại vật tại sân bay.</p>","translations":{"en":"Article 979. Performance planning for aircraft

Article 979. Performance planning for aircraft
1. When developing operating procedures, aircraft operators are responsible for taking into account factors affecting performance to ensure the aircraft performs the expected flight safely, including:
a) Weight of the aircraft;
b) Configuration of the aircraft;
c) Aircraft operating methods;
d) Operation of aircraft systems may adversely affect performance;
d) Runway slope;
e) Condition of runway surface;
g) Water surface condition, if relevant;
h) Pressure altitude and temperature;
i) Wind conditions;
k) Other environmental conditions that may adversely affect performance;
l) Accuracy of charts and data used.
2. When developing obstacle avoidance procedures during takeoff, landing and reentry, aircraft operators must take into account obstacle data at the airport."},"translatedText":"Article 979. Performance planning for aircraft

Article 979. Performance planning for aircraft
1. When developing operating procedures, aircraft operators are responsible for taking into account factors affecting performance to ensure the aircraft performs the expected flight safely, including:
a) Weight of the aircraft;
b) Configuration of the aircraft;
c) Aircraft operating methods;
d) Operation of aircraft systems may adversely affect performance;
d) Runway slope;
e) Condition of runway surface;
g) Water surface condition, if relevant;
h) Pressure altitude and temperature;
i) Wind conditions;
k) Other environmental conditions that may adversely affect performance;
l) Accuracy of charts and data used.
2. When developing obstacle avoidance procedures during takeoff, landing and reentry, aircraft operators must take into account obstacle data at the airport."},"980":{"id":"980","code":"Điều 980","title":"Điều 980. Lập kế hoạch tính năng đối với trực thăng","chapter":"Chương II - KIỂM SOÁT TÍNH NĂNG TÀU BAY","partTitle":"Phần XVII - TRỌNG LƯỢNG, CÂN BẰNG VÀ TÍNH NĂNG TÀU BAY","partId":"main_part_17","plainText":"Điều 980. Lập kế hoạch tính năng đối với trực thăng
