Article 1005. Objects and substances prohibited for transport by air
Aircraft operators must develop policies and operating procedures to ensure that objects and substances identified as prohibited for transport by air according to the provisions of Section 2.1 Chapter 2 Part 1 of ICAO Technical Instructions (Doc 9284) are not allowed on aircraft under any circumstances."},"translatedText":"Article 1005. Objects and substances prohibited for transport by air

Article 1005. Objects and substances prohibited for transport by air
