Article 1006. Classification of goods
Aircraft operators must develop dangerous goods operations procedures to ensure that objects and substances are classified as dangerous goods in accordance with the provisions of Technical Instructions (Doc 9284) of ICAO."},"translatedText":"Article 1006. Classification of goods

