Dangerous goods that have been classified, packaged, labeled and accepted for transport in accordance with the provisions of the Technical Instructions for Transport by Air at a location outside the airport may be transported by ground from that location to the airport provided that they comply with the provisions of Vietnamese law on transport of dangerous goods by road."},"translatedText":"Article 1025. Ground transportation

