Article 1033. List of RNAV standards
RNAV navigation standards include:
1. RNAV 10 applies to long-distance flight operations in ocean airspace or airspace far from areas with ground navigation infrastructure.
2. RNAV 5 applies to long-haul flight operations, continental airspace or the first phase of the procedure until published conditions allow.
3. RNAV 2 applies to long-haul flight operations, continental airspace, air traffic routes or procedures in the appropriate flight phase.
4. RNAV 1 applies to operations in continental airspace, air traffic routes, standard instrument departure procedures, standard instrument arrival procedures or the appropriate flight phase of an instrument approach procedure."},"translatedText":"Article 1033. List of RNAV standards

