5. A - RNP áp dụng cho hoạt động khai thác có yêu cầu chức năng RNP nâng cao, bao gồm chức năng bay theo RF, dịch chuyển song song đường bay, chuyển tiếp bán kính cố định hoặc chức năng khác được công bố cho đường bay, phương thức hoặc vùng trời áp dụng.</p>","translations":{"en":"Article 1034. List of RNP navigation standards

Article 1034. List of RNP navigation standards
RNP navigation standards include:
1. RNP 4 applies to long-distance flight operations in ocean airspace or airspace far from areas with ground navigation infrastructure.
2. RNP 2 applies to long-haul flight operations in oceanic airspace, airspace far from areas with ground navigation infrastructure or continental airspace when announced for application.
3. RNP 1 applies to air traffic routes, standard instrument departure procedures, standard instrument arrival procedures, initial approach phase, intermediate approach phase or reentry phase when applicable.
4. RNP 0.3 applies to helicopters during long-distance flight, arrival, departure, approach or re-flight when the route, procedure, airspace or operating area requires RNP 0.3.
5. A - RNP applies to operations that require advanced RNP functionality, including RF flight functionality, route parallel transfer, fixed radius transition or other functionality as published for the applicable route, procedure or airspace."},"translatedText":"Article 1034. List of RNP navigation standards

