5. Chương trình huấn luyện và kiểm tra định kỳ bao gồm 01 lần thực hiện phương thức tiếp cận tiêu chuẩn ngoài khơi mỗi năm trong chức năng người lái giám sát, người lái điều khiển hoặc người lái duy nhất, phù hợp với loại hình khai thác.
6. Phương thức tiếp cận tiêu chuẩn ngoài khơi được đưa vào chương trình huấn luyện hằng năm trên trực thăng hoặc thiết bị huấn luyện giả định, kiểm tra trên đường bay hoặc kiểm tra năng lực.</p>","translations":{"en":"Article 1150. Training and testing of standard offshore approaches

Article 1150. Training and testing of standard offshore approaches
1. Initial training and testing on standard offshore approaches is carried out as part of the aircraft operator's conversion training course or as a separate training course on equipment and procedures.
2. Ground training includes the following contents:
a) Knowledge of the structure of the standard offshore approach;
b) Technical standards, limitations, operating modes and usage of airborne radar;
c) Area navigation system when required for the proposed offshore standard approach.
3. Training on helicopters or simulators includes the following contents:
a) Perform standard offshore approaches to various offshore locations with or without obstructions;
b) Perform standard offshore approaches in various wind conditions, including landing and reentry;
c) Carry out a standard offshore approach in the role of supervising pilot, pilot pilot or sole pilot during the day and night, as appropriate to the type of operation.
4. Initial training and testing includes:
a) Flight operations under supervision;
b) Check on actual flight operations.
5. The periodic training and inspection program includes one performance of a standard offshore approach per year in the capacity of supervising pilot, pilot pilot or sole pilot, as appropriate to the type of operation.
6. Standard offshore approaches are included in the annual training program in helicopter or simulator training, en route testing or competency testing."},"translatedText":"Article 1150. Training and testing of standard offshore approaches

