Article 1179. Responsibilities of the proposer
1. Declare fully, truthfully and take responsibility for the accuracy of the application for issuance, re-issuance, amendment, extension and recognition of the Certificate of airworthiness.
2. Prepare aircraft, technical documents, and maintenance records for the Vietnam Aviation Administration to conduct inspection. In the case of newly manufactured aircraft, the applicant is required to arrange inspection during the production process to determine whether the aircraft complies with the type certificate or confirms compliance with technical standards and design data.
3. Bear the costs according to legal regulations during the process of checking, granting and recognizing the Certificate of airworthiness.
