Article 1187. Approval or recognition of type design changes
1. The Civil Aviation Authority of Vietnam approves major changes to a type design when, on the basis of assessment, it is determined that the design change meets the applicable approval basis, environmental protection requirements (if any) and does not give rise to characteristics or features that adversely affect the operational safety of the product.
2. The Civil Aviation Authority of Vietnam approves minor changes to the type design on the basis of assessment and determination that the design change meets the applicable approval basis, environmental protection requirements (if any) and does not significantly affect the airworthiness characteristics of the product.
