a) Cục Hàng không Việt Nam để phục vụ công tác đánh giá, giám sát và xác minh sự tuân thủ đối với dữ liệu phù hợp khai thác;
b) Tổ chức, cá nhân có trách nhiệm áp dụng hoặc tuân thủ các nội dung của dữ liệu phù hợp khai thác.</p>","translations":{"en":"Article 1190. Provision of suitable data for exploitation related to minor changes

Article 1190. Provision of suitable data for exploitation related to minor changes
In case a minor change is approved that affects the data suitable for exploitation, the approval owner is responsible for:
1. Provide relevant aircraft operators with a set of operationally appropriate data that has been updated to reflect the changes, before such data is put to use in operations or training activities.
2. Timely provide subsequent amendments and supplements of operational suitability data related to approved changes to relevant aircraft operators.
3. Provide appropriate data sections for exploitation upon request from:
a) Vietnam Aviation Administration to serve the assessment, supervision and verification of compliance with operationally appropriate data;
b) Organizations and individuals are responsible for applying or complying with the contents of data suitable for exploitation."},"translatedText":"Article 1190. Provision of suitable data for exploitation related to minor changes

