Article 1194. Sign permission to install aircraft equipment
1. Aircraft equipment, except standard spare parts, can only be installed on aircraft that have been issued or recognized with a Type Certificate when they simultaneously meet the following requirements:
a) Attached is the Certificate of Permission to Operate (CAAV Form 1) or Certificate of Permission to Operate as prescribed by the aviation authorities of the countries mentioned in Clause 2, Article 8 of Decree No. 223/2026/ND-CP on aircraft and aircraft operations;
b) Identified and labeled according to applicable regulations.
2. Equipment installation must be in accordance with the type design configuration or modified design that has been approved or recognized and be carried out in accordance with regulations on aircraft maintenance.
