2. Organizations and individuals that manufacture aircraft or aircraft engines must have identification signs for products made of fireproof materials and embossed or engraved or stamped the information specified in Clause 1 of this Article, or by other approved fireproof marking methods. The identification plate must be firmly installed on the product in a visible position and must not be eroded, blurred or moved during normal operation, nor lost or destroyed when the aircraft crashes.
3. Organizations and individuals manufacturing propeller blades, propeller blades or parts of propeller blades must have identification symbols for products embossed, engraved or stamped, or by other approved fireproof marking methods, the information specified in Clause 1 of this Article on non-critical areas of that product and ensure that the information is not eroded, blurred or moved during normal operation, or lost or destroyed when the aircraft crashes."},"1196":{"id":"1196","code":"Điều 1196","title":"Điều 1196. Số liệu nhận dạng sản phẩm","chapter":"Chương III - NHẬN DẠNG CÁC SẢN PHẨM VÀ THIẾT BỊ","partTitle":"Phần XXI - PHÊ CHUẨN, CÔNG NHẬN THAY ĐỔI THIẾT KẾ, TRANG THIẾT BỊ LẮP TRÊN TÀU BAY, ĐỘNG CƠ TÀU BAY, CÁNH QUẠT TÀU BAY, NHẬN DẠNG TRANG THIẾT BỊ TÀU BAY","partId":"main_part_21","plainText":"Điều 1196. Số liệu nhận dạng sản phẩm
