Article 1199. Proof of conformity
1. Manufacturing organizations and individuals are responsible for proving that products, equipment or spare parts are manufactured in accordance with applicable design data and are in a state eligible for use.
2. Demonstration of conformity is accomplished through inspection, testing, technical evaluation and manufacturing process control activities according to applicable design data.
3. During the process of granting, recognizing or approving designs, approving design changes and performing manufacturing supervision, the Civil Aviation Authority of Vietnam checks and evaluates the conformity of products, equipment or spare parts on the basis of:
a) Applicable design data;
b) Manufacturing process control system;
c) Inspection and testing results;
d) Relevant documents, data and technical evidence provided by manufacturing organizations and individuals.
4. The results of inspection and conformity assessment are the basis for carrying out manufacturing supervision activities and issuing documents permitting release according to the provisions of this Regulation."},"translatedText":"Article 1199. Proof of conformity

