Article 1221. Regulations on record keeping
1. Foreign aircraft operators operating in Vietnamese territory must keep the following documents at the departure airport in Vietnamese territory:
a) List of passengers;
b) Aircraft technical logbook confirming maintenance completion;
c) Calculation documents on weight and balance of center of gravity and payload.
2. Aircraft operators must develop a process to ensure record keeping is carried out in accordance with the provisions of Clause 1 of this Article.
