2. Quy trình đảm bảo phân phối dữ liệu dẫn đường điện tử đến tất cả các tàu bay theo yêu cầu.</p>","translations":{"en":"Article 1234. Electronic navigation data management program

Article 1234. Electronic navigation data management program
Aircraft operators must obtain approval from the Vietnam Aviation Administration for a program to use electronic navigation data when the aircraft is in the air or on the ground, including:
1. Monitoring procedures for processes using electronic navigation data and products.
2. Procedures to ensure electronic navigation data is distributed to all aircraft as required."},"translatedText":"Article 1234. Electronic navigation data management program

Article 1234. Electronic navigation data management program
Aircraft operators must obtain approval from the Vietnam Aviation Administration for a program to use electronic navigation data when the aircraft is in the air or on the ground, including:
1. Monitoring procedures for processes using electronic navigation data and products.
