e)	The current configuration of NAT HLA capability in an aircraft’s avionics system shall be reported to CAAV inspectors when requested.
2.32.7	NAT HLA Maintenance Program
a)	No special maintenance is needed beyond the existing Airbus MPD or VJC AMP.
